      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure thing! I've got a movie scheduled this evening. We should catch up and grab something to eat together. How about trying out that new Italian place downtown?",
